# Nothing in this repo gets its line endings rewritten on checkout.
#
# The room fixtures under spike/public/rooms/ are raw little-endian float32 - a checkout that
# rewrote a 0x0A byte inside a coordinate would corrupt the geometry silently, and this machine has
# core.autocrlf=true. The same applies to the source: a spike is measured, and a diff that is all
# line endings hides the change that moved the number.
* -text
